OL,3,GNEWSAApplause in court as father of    
OL,4,Amurdered teen warns killer 'prison will
OL,5,Anot go well'                           
OL,7,FOn Wednesday, Mears was sentenced to a 
OL,8,Fminimum of 20 years and six months in  
OL,9,Fprison, minus 282 days spent on remand.
OL,10,FHe will be on licence for the rest of  
OL,11,Fhis life.                              
